      },
      "message": "feat(3d): add waterlines switch to skip steep-flank ring pass\n\nAdd waterlines: bool (default true) across Finish3DParams, OpParams::Finish3D,\nParamsDto::Finish3D, MCP tools, and the 3D Finish Passes tab.\n\nWhen false on shallow-first patterns, the generator skips the waterline ring pass,\nemits a visible steep-flank note on Toolpath::notes (surfaced in the UI status\nbanner and MCP generate output), leaves uncut steep-flank stock visible to\ndownstream rest simulation, and refuses an all-steep model with GenError::Empty.\nRing-dependent patterns (Waterline, Blend, Morph) refuse waterlines: false by name.\n\nFixes #2811",
