      "message": "fix(3d): reset waterlines on ring-only pattern switch, fix row layout, and pin stamp\n\nReset waterlines to true when switching Finish3D Pattern to Waterline, Blend,\nor Morph, and keep the Steep flanks row visible if waterlines is false so it\nnever traps the user on a refused state. Stack the Waterlines and Leave uncut\nradios vertically inside prop_row so they do not overlap the row label. Add\nUI and direct operation::op_stamp regression tests pinning the 0x4E stamp byte.\n\nFixes #2811",
